Intel i69 67th GEN (Outclasses your faves)

The best CPU you've ever seen. (It can run a calculator at best)

## Features

- 256 memory locations
- Accumulator architecture
- Fetch-Decode-Execute cycle
- Arithmetic instructions
- Branch instructions
- Input/Output

## Instruction Set

000 - HALT
1xx - ADD
2xx - SUB
5xx - LDA
6xx - STO
7xx - BRA
8xx - BRZ
901 - INPUT
902 - OUTPUT

Side note: No actual assembler yet so wait for the programming update ig.
